00:04:44.784 --> 00:04:46.618
-I know, I know.

00:04:46.618 --> 00:04:49.656
-So just try not to say
those kind of things, okay?

00:04:49.656 --> 00:04:51.023
-Okay.

00:04:51.023 --> 00:04:52.491
-That's what I'm talking about.

00:04:52.491 --> 00:04:53.825
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:53.825 --> 00:04:55.762
Will Ferrell, Paul Rudd,
everybody!

00:04:55.762 --> 00:04:58.197
New episode of
